things that we need to do uh in our um

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:43.990
in this introductory course.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.389
Um however as I said there are other

00:10:46.399 --> 00:10:47.990
wait statements. These can also be

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.310
useful in simulation. Wait on signal is

