synthesizable design. So I just wanted

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.069
to show you alternative approaches to

00:10:58.079 --> 00:11:01.509
ones I've mentioned already. Um my

00:11:01.519 --> 00:11:04.150
preference in writing processes is to

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:06.310
use the process sensitivity sensitivity

